    "name": "Exercise 3 - CRUD on Todos",
    "description": "Intermediate: Master the full CRUD cycle (Create, Read, Update, Delete) on the DummyJSON Todos resource. Understand simulated vs real API behaviour.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
